509	     * ({@code namesakeCount} is {@code 0}), {@code 2} for a household of {@code 3} or more
510	     * members ({@code householdSize}), and {@code 3} for tenure of at least one elapsed
511	     * fiscal year (the {@code registrationDate}'s fiscal year precedes the current fiscal
512	     * year, the fiscal year starting on 1 July). Because a newly created owner is still in
513	     * the current fiscal year, a new owner can score at most {@code 5} points.
